# Analytics + AdSense (every HTML page)

## Google Analytics — required on ALL HTML pages
Measurement ID is always `G-XXZS8C1FLY`. Never omit it. Never use another GA property (`G-TMJQ8CNQKL` is retired).

Place immediately after `<head>` (AdSense script may sit above it):

```html
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-XXZS8C1FLY"></script>
<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-XXZS8C1FLY');</script>
```

Applies to: homepage, tools, problems, courses, premium, legal, admin, redirects, 404.

## AdSense — required on public content pages
Publisher is only `ca-pub-6672302762343789` (matches `ads.txt`). Never `ca-pub-4218140747629892` or typo pubs.

```html
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-6672302762343789" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
```

Put it on: learning articles, tools, problems, premium course lessons, category indexes.

Skip AdSense only on: `/admin/` and empty HTTP-refresh redirect stubs.

If you create or edit an HTML file and either tag is missing, add it in the same edit.
